{"c":[{"id":"d7fa6d069180cfdc","sum":"B15-B16: Chrome ignores AXSelectedTextRange writes on web inputs, so insert is refused there; caret-fixture cannot take the front from T3; rerun bundle-fixture.sh after any swift build that changes the fixture, or evals run the old one.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261003T135628Z-a8acf778077d3916","text":"Chrome ignores AXSelectedTextRange writes on web inputs (selection stays 0+0), so the insert fallback is refused there; and caret-fixture's 'activate legacy' cannot take the front from T3 Code, only from apps the eval launched (B15).","type":"note"},{"name":"20261003T145037Z-c765ed8386dc228d","text":"Evals exec CaretFixture.app, a copy of caret-fixture made by apps/screen-reader/scripts/bundle-fixture.sh: rerun it after every swift build that changes the fixture, or the eval runs the old one (B16 lost two planner cases to an 08:33 bundle).","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"9390cf8f12481e1c","sum":"A11: host-only memory contracts (add op, permission uses) live in Tests/CaretHostCoreTests/Fixtures/memory.ndjson; typed values wait in MemoryBook. ImageRenderer can't draw TextField/ScrollView: use EntryField and ScrollingColumn, which draw stand-ins off screen.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261003T141909Z-1887ef6a0983e76b","text":"Helper memoryRequest has no add op and records no permission uses; the host's contract for both is apps/caret/Tests/CaretHostCoreTests/Fixtures/memory.ndjson, and typed values wait in MemoryBook (memory only) until a helper accepts add (A11).","type":"note"},{"name":"20261003T141909Z-b0300a8600af9266","text":"ImageRenderer cannot draw TextField or ScrollView: Caret windows use EntryField and ScrollingColumn (Design/EntryField.swift), which draw still stand-ins when Gallery.png sets rendersOffscreen (A11).","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
